                    House Situation Room. Drafted by Tarnoff; approved by Vance. (National Archives,
                    RG 59, Central Foreign Policy File, P840140–2243)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d138-f2" n="2" xml:id="d138-f2-content">
                <p> Vance visited Israel and Egypt, August 5–9.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
